    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Storm Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(air, aura, evocation, primal, water)\n\n100 feet. The thunderbird is surrounded by a cyclone of wind and driving rain. This area is greater difficult terrain for flying creatures, who must successfully Maneuver in Flight (27) or be blown 30 feet away from the thunderbird. Creatures on the ground must succeed at a 27 Reflex save to perform any move action and are knocked prone on a critical failure. The driving rain in the storm aura imposes a \u20132 circumstance penalty on Perception checks and extinguishes smaller flames. A thunderbird can deactivate or activate the storm aura as a free action with the concentrate trait."
            },
            "id": "62bb146c-945d-400c-beac-76c1eb16873d",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:01.456335"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stormsight"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Wind, precipitation, and clouds don't impair a thunderbird's vision; it ignores the concealed condition from storms, mist, precipitation, and the like."
            },
            "id": "0d142111-4f5e-452e-b19c-eb701086bcd7",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:01.456335"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stormflight"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A thunderbird can move in wind with ease. They don't treat wind as difficult terrain or need to Maneuver in Flight in high winds."
            },
            "id": "3690c08d-977d-4c1f-a1f0-f99ed9d22bd6",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:01.456335"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Thunderstrike"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A creature that takes damage from a thunderbird's thunderbolt Strike must succeed at a 28 Fortitude save or be knocked prone and deafened for 1 round."
            },
            "id": "cf72f200-12de-4023-b57c-e7f81005bc01",
